# Session-handoff briefs are scratch and must never be committed.
# The session-handoff skill writes only this reserved name; see ~/.claude/skills/session-handoff.
# Deliberately NOT a bare "*handoff*" pattern — DESKTOP-UI-HANDOFF.md, *-wecom-ui-handoff.md
# and book chapters on handoff mechanisms are legitimate tracked docs.
session-handoff-*.md
